<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back on mkt at NZ$6.91/7.00.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back on mkt at NZ$6.91/7.00.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand Ltd said on Tuesday it bought shares on market during the day at prices between NZ$6.91 and $7.00 in the latest round of its buyback programme.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said it bought 200,000 shares. The buyback is set to continue until Telecom advises it has completed the current phase.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom +64-4 473 4746</p>
</text>
